=head1 DESCRIPTION

This object contains information about this Live Tail session,
including the log groups included and the log stream filters, if any.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 LogEventFilterPattern => Str

An optional pattern to filter the results to include only log events
that match the pattern. For example, a filter pattern of C<error 404>
displays only log events that include both C<error> and C<404>.

For more information about filter pattern syntax, see Filter and
Pattern Syntax
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/logs/FilterAndPatternSyntax.html).


=head2 LogGroupIdentifiers => ArrayRef[Str|Undef]

An array of the names and ARNs of the log groups included in this Live
Tail session.


=head2 LogStreamNamePrefixes => ArrayRef[Str|Undef]

If your StartLiveTail operation request included a
C<logStreamNamePrefixes> parameter that filtered the session to only
include log streams that have names that start with certain prefixes,
these prefixes are listed here.


=head2 LogStreamNames => ArrayRef[Str|Undef]

If your StartLiveTail operation request included a C<logStreamNames>
parameter that filtered the session to only include certain log
streams, these streams are listed here.


=head2 RequestId => Str

The unique ID generated by CloudWatch Logs to identify this Live Tail
session request.


=head2 SessionId => Str

The unique ID generated by CloudWatch Logs to identify this Live Tail
session.



